  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM &amp; Adaptive Management dialog PAO 27 May 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM &amp; Adaptive Management dialogdag PAO 27 maj 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den 27 maj arrangerade Sida en dialogdag f&#xf6;r de partianknutna organisationerna (PAO) inom ramen f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Strategi f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;rskilt demokratist&#xf6;d genom svenska partianknutna organisationer 2023-2027. Samtliga PAO deltog, totalt ca 30 personer. Syftet med dialogdagen var att genom medverkan av relevant expertis samt erfarenhetsutbyte m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra kapacitetsutveckling f&#xf6;r PAO. Dialogdagen fokuserade p&#xe5; desinformation samt resultatuppf&#xf6;ljning. F&#xf6;r eftermiddagspasset &#xe4;mnar Sida anlita en extern expert inom resultatfr&#xe5;gor, experten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas ha erfarenhet fr&#xe5;n arbete med CSOs, inkl PAO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 27 May, Sida arranged a dialogue day for the party-affiliated organisations (PAO) within the framework of the implementation of the Strategy for special democracy support through Swedish party-affiliated organisations 2023-2027. All PAOs participated, a total of about 30 people. The purpose of the dialogue day was to enable capacity development for PAO through the participation of relevant expertise and exchange of experience. The dialogue day focused on disinformation and results follow-up. For the afternoon session, Sida intends to hire an external expert in performance issues, the expert is expected to have experience from working with CSOs, including PAO.</narrative>
  </description>
